5. Cyclomatic Complexity per Line (v_per_loc): Reflects localized complexity, which can highlight areas of intricate logic that may invite errors.
6. Interaction of Unique Operators with Complexity (operator_complexity_interaction): Models a combined effect of branching, operators, and complexity, which may exacerbate defect likelihood.

These characteristics address varying aspects of the defect risk: logical complexity, effort, and code volume interactions. They provide a foundation for further analysis or feature synthesis as they capture essential properties of software prone to defects.

